<p>
<font size=5>R</font>estore meadow and riparian plant communities to enhance fish and wildlife habitat and stabilize streambanks.
<P>
<b><u>Results Expected</u></b>
<p>

<ol type="a">
<li>Native shrub and herbaceous riparian vegetation will evolve toward plant density and diversity resembling 1936 conditions
<li>Overhanging vegetation and undercut banks that will increase fish habitat, provide nutrient source and woody debris, and decrease stream temperatures
<li>Cover and food sources for terrestrial wildlife/waterfowl
<li>Growth of dense, deep root systems will stabilize banks resulting in reduced erosion and improved water quality
</ol>
